s in your pantry to keep pantry bugs away \n4. Place lemons and orange peels around your drains then flush with boiling water to keep bugs from entering through the drains \n5. And wipe peppermint oil on your ceilings to prevent spiders and spider webs\n\nWhich one will you try first? \n\n#homehacks #hometips #tipsandtricks #cleaninghacks", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T08:50:55.000Z", "videoDuration": 22.1, "videoPlayCount": 192390, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 3972, "commentsCount": 18, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fmex30-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/786069687_18105166409190993_1284994430855046773_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MjEyNDY4NjMzODk0NjM0MTE4MTA1MTY2NDAzMTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=hsNbBZJjVDMQ7kNvwF1Y0ez&_nc_oc=AdoePOJFKY0Zoi6PT1IAk0Hia6z7DE83lvUVkvFvVrDQEleDWaZ8RVDVxp4nW7qopQg&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fmex30-1.fna&_nc_gid=elq3v2RjiGhmffcEvV_4Hg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKS1GJ4lAJ0754UPIAv6o6tJevAko7pWl-aK1rGiPmu9A&oe=6A9A1C2F", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOwt9lkfTGh8Eb82xILUkV9DDFrLNK78Zedf2BNM9l6QMsD4sdNQSeoGgLQbLkRWmWaJgbEbLuRZoks5iDsaKok7pd9QU_52mllyJo.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=tUhUwowMJvsQ7kNvwHBd0M0&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjQzNDgxODUzMzcwNzY5OSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjQsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyMiwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=36d18ffacc25e054&_nc_&_nc_gid=LTQvOXnseXgR6kz_CYtEaw&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKe9gc9JuWXdn0PbirXRNFHQDWbQMenWJMsLL3FwrgkoA&oe=6A9634CB", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "mama_mila_au", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "282128870