th a clean machine, so make sure your machine's drain pump is empty as all that stagnant water can cause musty smell. Then clean your detergent tray to remove hidden buildup. Always make sure to fasten zips, but leave buttons open as they can pull in the wash. And you can also wash in your darks with one cup of Epsom salt to prevent fading. Wash and dry your socks in a mesh laundry bag and you will never lose a sock in laundry again. And use less detergent. One tablespoon is often all you need. Too much can leave a buildup and make clothes feel stiff.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "List"}, {"shortCode": "DcYExeFSZKq", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcYExeFSZKq/", "caption": "#4 is a game changer for dirty stovetop burners \ud83d\ude4c which trick will you try first?\n1. Keep fruit flies away by adding cinnamon to your fruit bowl - they hate the smell!\n2. Clean water bottles with 2 denture tablets to remove stains + odours. Soak for 10 mins then wash as usual.\n3. Mix 1 cup water, 1 tbs dish soap and 1 tbs lemon juice to make an amazing kitchen degreasing spray\n4. And you can use this mix on stovetop burners with steel wool to leave them sparkling\n5. Heat a spoon in boiling water before measuring honey so it doesn\u2019t stick to the spoon\n\nHope these were helpful lovelies xx\n\n#homehacks #hometips #homesweethome #cleaninghacks", "timestamp": "2026-08-23T08:40:29.000Z", "videoDuration": 22.5, "videoPlayCount": 139909, "likesCount": 1407, "commentsCount": 9, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fpoz5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/781579013_18104863961190993_901800547906646784_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=Mzk2OTk0NDA2MzI2ODQ1OTE3ODE4MTA0ODYzOTU4MTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzIifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=uYkPeIM_7VEQ7kNvwFj-_3I&_nc_oc=AdrPEH46dC3zR0jaur4fDUZNTLTAI-beSyTg-Uab6OjuR2wDf-wuQnGFfWfp4NK9DGs&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagr