sheets Sunday \u2601\ufe0f\ud83e\udd0d which trick will you try first? \n1. Spray linen spray on cotton balls and place them into your vacuum canister (where the rubbish goes) then as you vacuum your room will smell amazing. Empty your vacuum bin after use.\n2. Simmer coffee with some vanilla to absorb any odours in the air\n3. While your mattress is airing, wash linen as usual but add 1 cup baking soda and eucalyptus oil to the drum, to rid dust mites and leave your linen soft and brighter\n\nHope these were helpful lovelies xx \n\n#bedroommakeover #bedroomaesthetic #bedroomrefresh #homefragrance #tipsandtrick", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T08:41:02.000Z", "videoDuration": 25.401178, "videoPlayCount": 193570, "likesCount": 2122, "commentsCount": 16, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/779200918_18104568854190993_4472413523886919113_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=Mzk2Nzc3MTA2OTIyNjE1MzM3MDE4MTA0NTY4ODQ4MTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=jimGtAmWlSkQ7kNvwGZsqQY&_nc_oc=AdoW7qR2o62MMhRhfcinsNL7hLIXBIvGAz1ktLCwgUkzxEaMHCAJJ7ee1y8vpZPcnRlyxjQn2yf6EzsLEscmIgy9&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=XiCqD5dFi_c3T1U2eUr1gA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIwhN6NpgAu9lsZQ_o6qctHSw7FxHTViGJUjduwiEB0Eg&oe=6A9A00A2", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOhoOeBOW5uNsBFnjc_OtFlY9-nic76dnyOdrBrN0CoBlKueTPr1logwPnSJZeOiGTRPz2pugUjcE14bV3CSZl3NOU-pD6AwzLsJug.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=QPID1pQDz98Q7kNvwEsX27p&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM3MDY4NDEwNDc0MDg5MiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjEwLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=2cd4a548a3cae&_nc_&_nc_gid=XiCqD5dFi_c3T1U2eUr1gA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIH2tlhFaSZIylU0ku-N_iGU15Mzoi4mObRdjfTPN4cNQ&oe=6A962EA0", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "mama_mila_au", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "37768978132750575"}, "ownerUsername": "mama_mila_au", "ownerFullName": "Chantel Mila", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 156654, "likes": 1707, "comments": 15}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 193570, "likes": 2122, "comments": 16}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "If you like your room to smell like a luxury hotel, you need to try these three tricks. You guys know how much I love to spray linen spray on cotton balls and place them inside your vacuum canister. Then as you vacuum, your room will smell amazing. Coffee is an amazing natural deodorizer, so simmer it with some vanilla to absorb any odors in the air. Then while your mattress is airing, wash your linen as usual, but add one cup of baking soda and eucalyptus oil to the drum. This helps remove dust mites and leaves your linen softer and brighter.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "List", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcIhqPmSZL2", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcIhqPmSZL2/", "caption": "Some of your top requests! Which trick will you try first? \ud83c\udf3b Save this video to make cleaning your home a little easier x\n\n1. Clean stovetop burners with a wet pumice stone to remove years of burnt on grease. This one works so well, just make sure both the pumice stone and burners are wet \u263a\ufe0f\n2. I love to use a dish brush filled with dish soap and white vinegar to make cleaning your entire bathroom easy\n3. You can also add clove oil to this mix to combat mould on your shower door seal\n4. Buff shaving cream onto hazy mirrors to make them shine and keep fingerprints away \n5. And wipe your doors with lavender or peppermint oil to keep spiders away (skip this one if you have pets!) \n\nHo