 vinegar to make cleaning your entire bathroom easy. And you can also add clove oil to this mix to combat mould on your shower door seal. Yes, that seal comes off. Buff shaving cream onto hazy mirrors to make them shine and wipe your doors with lavender oil to keep spiders away.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "List", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "Db-U2BOy4a9", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db-U2BOy4a9/", "caption": "Say goodbye to dingy whites \ud83d\udc4b this method works so well to whiten and brighten stained white clothing, linen, socks and towels and leave them looking new again \ud83e\udd0d save this video for when you need it next xx \n\n#clotheswhitening #tipsandtricks #homehacks #laundryhacks #mamamilastips", "timestamp": "2026-08-13T08:38:38.000Z", "videoDuration": 26.333334, "videoPlayCount": 877080, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 11949, "commentsCount": 152, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fyqm1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/773800118_18103791860190993_4939157031618817869_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=Mzk2MjY5NjM5NTIzNjU0MjE0MTE4MTAzNzkxODU0MTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTYuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ZVdO2YCR3r8Q7kNvwEiCK9x&_nc_oc=AdqfRxYsAJoY5OI-GEXqNHIBmWZv_d7hxSc3OrBDNG1QOEf96nLiEu0Vl7nTV9ucjDs&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fyqm1-1.fna&_nc_gid=09C5RmdD5lfdTeIn7LbafA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJGVqfRN9zzs7mQnWvlYz_x3QkM698JK8EROyAYhjVaEg&oe=6A9A13D3", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fyqm1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOfUOquTnBr8cLaH91zDW8Y7ob9SHnPGGfWpGmdayJPKylCl5xl-R0XdBbJr2IfatWlboe5RVnY8EmVQPJlOLEqR-7JkZhGT2e3VAI.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdoctUyNEZVLNBlPpFNFrxhfunvz4-y6VWD5BKNYgUrloEFmfj8GB8ydnp67LQp1uvg&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fyqm1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=rgwb9gUGWSwQ7kNvwEIEe9I&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfY