re\u2019s a recap of some of your favourite tips from this year so far \ud83d\udc9b\n1. Prevent hard water marks on your taps by buffing in a thin layer of candle wax\n2. Clean your bins with peppermint oil to repel bugs and spiders\n3. If your clothes are covered in hair or fluff, throw a baby wipe into the wash to grab all the lint and hair \n4. Boil coffee, cinnamon and vanilla on your stovetop to make your home smell amazing before guests arrive\n5. And you can also place coffee anywhere you need odours removed \n6. A mix of 1 cup hydrogen peroxide and 20 drops clove oil is amazing at cutting through tough mould all around your home\n7. And wipe doors with lavender oil to keep bugs and spiders away \n\nHope these are helpful lovelies xx \n\n#hometips #homehacks #tipsandtricks #mamamilastips #homesweethome", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T03:42:28.000Z", "videoDuration": 29.95229, "videoPlayCount": 252052, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 4294, "commentsCount": 23, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/771814779_18103579835190993_6691154171886354192_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzk2MTA5Nzc3NTg1Mjc1MzcyMzE4MTAzNTc5ODI5MTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTYuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=_FdVSeLI_80Q7kNvwHk5YrT&_nc_oc=Adq30vbaRToOco5m513kA8YP5cp3gNfDyrKuVjNJ7nsOwWBWaSj4TbM8Wo_S3cK8f4o&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=yMyhViBAY0iFiJ4nkRdDsg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKJqbFpk3bjPTNLMab_wJIqvz-iIZUv_wmHAtgsbLeRUw&oe=6A9A33B2", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPA1ErU3QatVgU-bdkZJ2KA2f0qr27XFkrsnouQFQQyoBEsiHS5UY0VCKDmSx8SKYrlpT8HOepbxUiv_B2XkwLhZaOqz3LHqwsMor0.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=0wbD13frIu0Q7kNvwGdAF3Q&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92M